--Description: 7)  For every purchase line (non‑cancelled, before 2023‑01‑01) show its user,
--               purchase timestamp, and the integer month offset from that user’s very first
--               purchase (0 = first‑purchase month, 1 = second, etc.).  LIMIT 20 for preview.
